Data Preparation
HR Dataset
1,470 records and 35 variables
Missing-value validation
Duplicate validation
Data-type validation
Category validation
Suspicious-value checks
Derived variables: `AttritionFlag`, `AgeBand`, `TenureBand`, `IncomeBand`
Customer Churn Dataset
7,043 records and 21 original variables
`TotalCharges` converted to numeric
Blank zero-tenure `TotalCharges` values handled as zero
Duplicate validation
Data-type validation
Category validation
Suspicious-value checks
Derived variables: `ChurnFlag`, `SeniorCitizenLabel`, `TenureBand`, `MonthlyChargeBand`, `ServiceCount`
