How to Run
Open `RShiny_HR_Churn_Dashboard.Rproj` in RStudio.
Install packages:
```r
install.packages(c(
  "shiny", "dplyr", "tidyr", "readr",
  "ggplot2", "plotly", "DT", "scales"
))
```
Run:
```r
shiny::runApp(".")
```
Or click Run App in RStudio.
The application validates the expected source data:
HR: 1,470 rows
Telco: 7,043 rows
With all Customer Churn filters set to `All`, the expected baseline is:
Total Customers: 7,043
Churned Customers: 1,869
Churn Rate: approximately 26.5%
